Error [E0111]: `tensor` was made with `::`, so it can't be changed
  --> tests/ui/compute_set_immutable.jet:5:18
    |
  5 |     compute.set(&tensor, [0, 1], 3.0) ?? panic("set")
    |                  ^^^^^^
 Why: `set` will change this value, so it must be mutable (`:=`)
 Fix: Declare it with `tensor := ...`
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0111
